*Proof:* We will use directed segments for the proof. Note that it is enough to show that  $\overrightarrow{XU} = \overrightarrow{VY}$ . We will additionally show that  $\overrightarrow{XU} = \overrightarrow{VY} = \frac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{BC}$ . Now, note that 
        \begin{align*}
